Single choke point for all top-level redirects is src/routes/+layout.server.ts (full file, 9 lines):
```ts
import { redirect } from '@sveltejs/kit';
import type { LayoutServerLoad } from './$types';

export const load: LayoutServerLoad = async ({ locals, url }) => {
	const open = url.pathname === '/' || url.pathname === '/login';
	if (!locals.user && !open) throw redirect(302, '/login');
	if (locals.user && url.pathname === '/login') throw redirect(302, '/app');
	return { user: locals.user };
};
```
Add the mirror-image rule for `/`: a logged-in user hitting the marketing/room-search home page should land on their joined rooms instead. Insert a third condition:
```ts
