**Where "device-only" is known client-side**: `$page.data.user?.is_device`, populated end-to-end by [[add_device_cookie_and_session_plumbing]] (session cookie → `hooks.server.ts` → `+layout.server.ts`'s existing `return { user: locals.user };`, unchanged, already flows through) and correctly cleared the moment either linking step in [[add_account_credential_linking]] issues a fresh session with `is_device: false`.

